WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:02.599
I'm taking the Wizard to the Sanguine Court.

2
00:00:02.887 --> 00:00:04.877
Come on, little guy. You're with me.

3
00:00:05.320 --> 00:00:07.575
Ray of Frost. Two hits for one card.

4
00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:11.243
Empower Ray of Frost with this staff and you draw a Burn card.

5
00:00:11.687 --> 00:00:14.755
And this little watch can keep them frozen for another turn.

6
00:00:15.933 --> 00:00:18.609
I keep meaning to get that herb garden going.

7
00:00:20.493 --> 00:00:22.857
A wheat field gives the hero more health.

8
00:00:23.453 --> 00:00:26.197
The chicken coop does the same for your companion.

9
00:00:26.553 --> 00:00:28.634
There's the Treant. I'll come back for him.

10
00:00:30.253 --> 00:00:32.860
A Recruit event. That bear can join the party.

11
00:00:35.107 --> 00:00:38.049
The Bear’s Sunder halves the enemy’s Block before it hits.

12
00:00:39.653 --> 00:00:44.303
The Knight’s ultimate, Blessed Aegis, gives her Block, heals an ally, and deals Holy damage.

13
00:00:45.440 --> 00:00:47.347
The goblin pays extra hide.

14
00:00:48.080 --> 00:00:50.434
The Mud Elemental drops an amulet.

15
00:00:50.613 --> 00:00:54.018
A voyage through the Desert. You can check the route before you embark.

16
00:00:54.980 --> 00:00:57.356
Sanguine Court. Let's go meet the Countess.
